---
layout: base.njk
title: Chat with my CV
permalink: /chat/
description: Ask an AI assistant trained on João Silva's CV, website and university page.
---
<h1>Chat with my CV</h1>
<p class="lede">{{ cv.chat.intro }}</p>

{% if cv.chat.iframe_src %}
<div class="chat-frame">
  <iframe src="{{ cv.chat.iframe_src }}" title="João Silva CV Assistant" allow="clipboard-write" loading="lazy"></iframe>
</div>
{% else %}
<p class="notice">The assistant is being set up. Until it's ready, write to me at <a href="mailto:{{ cv.profile.email }}">{{ cv.profile.email }}</a>.</p>
{% endif %}

{% if cv.chat.bot_url %}
<p>Prefer a full window? <a href="{{ cv.chat.bot_url }}">Open the assistant on its own page</a>.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2 class="section-title">Things you could ask</h2>
<ul class="plain">
  <li>Where does João study, and what?</li>
  <li>What did João build at FlyRank.ai and Mindshaker?</li>
  <li>Which AI projects has João worked on?</li>
  <li>Que línguas fala o João?</li>
</ul>
